{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2017-817", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2017/817", "wordCount": 2011, "segments": [{"start": 27.0, "text": "You guys know that sound, right?"}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "You know, you've probably seen"}, {"start": 29.0, "text": "that badge before."}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "I know we're all familiar with"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "notifications."}, {"start": 33.0, "text": "And often they're really, really"}, {"start": 35.0, "text": "great. You know, there's lots of"}, {"start": 36.0, "text": "reasons to be excited when you"}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "hear that sound."}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "Maybe it's an iMessage you're"}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "eagerly awaiting, your favorite"}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "app has something to share,"}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "maybe you've got something on"}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "social media that is just"}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "totally blowing up."}, {"start": 46.0, "text": "Like, notifications, they're"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "really fun and they're a big"}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "reason we love our iPhones so"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "much."}, {"start": 52.0, "text": "But I think as we all know maybe"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "too much of a good thing is not"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "always such a good thing, right?"}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "And I would imagine there's a"}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "few of you that have some apps"}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "that look like this, right?"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "So let's talk about what we can"}, {"start": 64.0, "text": "do to make sure all these"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "notifications are something"}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "really great?"}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "So first off, let's be mindful"}, {"start": 70.0, "text": "of people's time."}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "You know, we should send"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "notifications only when they're"}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "relevant."}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "Don't spam."}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "Don't send them to boost traffic"}, {"start": 77.0, "text": "or engagement, but only when"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "your app has some important"}, {"start": 80.0, "text": "information to share."}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "When asking for permission to"}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "send them, you know, be clear"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "why."}, {"start": 85.0, "text": "Explain what notifications are"}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "going to be about, and the value"}, {"start": 88.0, "text": "that they will provide."}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "You know, because there is a"}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "real consequence if you send too"}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "many and they're not informative"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "or useful."}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "You know, people can shut them"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "off, or maybe even delete your"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "app."}, {"start": 97.0, "text": "And nobody wants that."}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "I'd like to stress this point"}, {"start": 100.0, "text": "here. Don't think of notifications as"}, {"start": 102.0, "text": "just a hook into your app."}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "You know, they should be a"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "self-contained package of"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "information that allows you to"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "complete a specific task."}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "Because if someone does interact"}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "with your notification, we want"}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "to make sure it is worthwhile to"}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "them. Because if you create delightful"}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "and useful notifications, there"}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "is a real opportunity to create"}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "a bond between people and your"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "app, and that is going to create"}, {"start": 121.0, "text": "a real value for you as"}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "developers, and real value for"}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "everyone that uses your app."}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "So, to make sure we're on the"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "same page here, let's talk about"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "what makes a rich notification."}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "Starting with a Short Look, this"}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "should answer the question: What"}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "is this notification about?"}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "So when you're creating these,"}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "make sure you're following the"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "current APIs."}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "You know, we just had some"}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "updates in iOS 11, take"}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "advantage of those."}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "We want to make sure you"}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "populate all the proper fields"}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "and labels."}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "And take a minute to make sure"}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "the language that you're using"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "here is clear, informative and"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "direct."}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "So now if you use 3D Touch and"}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "you press on the notification,"}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "you get what we like to call the"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "Long Look."}, {"start": 162.0, "text": "And here is where you should"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "provide some additional context,"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "some additional information"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "around your notification."}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "So here, you can see in the"}, {"start": 170.0, "text": "calendar notification I get more"}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "details about the event, and I"}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "get to see a detail of my day,"}, {"start": 176.0, "text": "and that's the extra content"}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "that makes this really valuable."}, {"start": 179.0, "text": "It's nice to know more about the"}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "event, but it is really helpful"}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "in this case to know if I'm"}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "free, because at the bottom of"}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "the notification there can be"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "some optional Quick Actions."}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "So if it relates to the"}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "notification, add some relevant"}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "buttons."}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "Remember, we want people to see"}, {"start": 192.0, "text": "the alert, get the information"}, {"start": 194.0, "text": "they need, do what they need to"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "do, and then get back to what"}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "they were just doing."}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "So now that I know that I'm"}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "free, I can go on and I can"}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "accept the invitation."}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "I never had to launch the"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "calendar app, and I never lost"}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "context of what I was doing."}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "So in creating a notification,"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "remember, the Short Look should"}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "describe what the notification"}, {"start": 211.0, "text": "is about."}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "The Long Look should provide"}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "some contextually relevant"}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "information, and the Quick"}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "Actions should provide some"}, {"start": 218.0, "text": "quick actions."}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "So let's get into some examples"}, {"start": 222.0, "text": "now of what great, rich"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "notifications look like, and all"}, {"start": 225.0, "text": "the different things you can do."}, {"start": 227.0, "text": "So here is a notification for"}, {"start": 229.0, "text": "mail. And you can see you are"}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "presented with the sender's"}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "name, the subject of the"}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "message, and a few lines of"}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "preview."}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "Now, when I expand this open, I"}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "get to see the rest of the"}, {"start": 238.0, "text": "message."}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "So at a minimum, this is what we"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "want to be doing. And if you've got some content"}, {"start": 243.0, "text": "that gets truncated in the Short"}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "Look, let's show the rest of it"}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "in the Long Look."}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "The next thing we can do to make"}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "notifications more useful is by"}, {"start": 252.0, "text": "adding an image."}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "So here is Photos, sending a"}, {"start": 254.0, "text": "notification."}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "You can see the stream it was"}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "posted to."}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "You could see who posted it, and"}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "there is a thumbnail on the"}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "right-hand side there."}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "Those are all helpful bits of"}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "information."}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "Now, in this Long Look, I can"}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "just see a big version of the"}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "photo and some relevant quick"}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "actions."}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "So remember here, when you're"}, {"start": 270.0, "text": "adding an image, it doesn't need"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "to be just a photograph."}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "This is where you can use some"}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "of your app UI."}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "So if you have custom UI, custom"}, {"start": 277.0, "text": "typography, elements that make"}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "your app unique, you should add"}, {"start": 280.0, "text": "them here."}, {"start": 281.0, "text": "You know, just like our calendar"}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "example from before."}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "Or if you have a data-heavy app,"}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "maybe you have charts and"}, {"start": 287.0, "text": "graphs, flow diagrams, things"}, {"start": 289.0, "text": "like that, you can add those."}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "If you have a weather app, maybe"}, {"start": 291.0, "text": "you should show the conditions"}, {"start": 293.0, "text": "graphically, present stock"}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "charts if that's your app."}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "You know, show information as"}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "it's designed in your app."}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "Here you can see when Tips"}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "presents a notification, they"}, {"start": 305.0, "text": "tell you what it is, right in"}, {"start": 307.0, "text": "the Short Look."}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "Now, when you expand it, this"}, {"start": 311.0, "text": "notification really comes to"}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "life with video content and"}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "plays a movie, and it shows you"}, {"start": 315.0, "text": "the tip."}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "It's an example where I don't"}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "need to go into the app to learn"}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "what the tip is about."}, {"start": 319.0, "text": "I get all the information I need"}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "right in the video in line with"}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "the Long Look."}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "So I think a nice example here"}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "might be for games. You know I think if you're"}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "playing chess or some other"}, {"start": 329.0, "text": "turn-by-turn game like that, you"}, {"start": 331.0, "text": "know, when someone makes a move,"}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "you can show their last turn"}, {"start": 333.0, "text": "back to them right in the"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "notification."}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "Now remember, these examples are"}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "bringing notifications to life"}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "with UI animations."}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "And if those are a big part of"}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "your app, use those in the"}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "notifications."}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "But you can also have"}, {"start": 344.0, "text": "traditional video content here"}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "as well."}, {"start": 346.0, "text": "So if you have news clips,"}, {"start": 348.0, "text": "sports highlights, things like"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "that, if video is a part of your"}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "app, make that a part of your"}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "notifications."}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "So here is a Missed Call in"}, {"start": 355.0, "text": "Voicemail notification."}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "I can see my friend, Chance, he"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "gave me a call, left a"}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "voicemail."}, {"start": 361.0, "text": "And when I get to the Long Look here, I can see the missed call,"}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "I can listen to the audio"}, {"start": 364.0, "text": "message or I can just read the"}, {"start": 366.0, "text": "transcription, all without ever"}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "having to go into the phone app."}, {"start": 369.0, "text": "Everything I need to know about"}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "the missed call is here, the"}, {"start": 371.0, "text": "audio, the transcript, and some"}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "relevant actions."}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "It's a nice, self-contained"}, {"start": 375.0, "text": "package."}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "So we've talked about you can"}, {"start": 379.0, "text": "add images, you can add video,"}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "audio to your notifications,"}, {"start": 383.0, "text": "well the next thing you could do"}, {"start": 384.0, "text": "is have a custom view that"}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "updates live."}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "So here is Find My Friends."}, {"start": 387.0, "text": "Chance wants to share his"}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "location with me."}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "And when I expand this"}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "notification, I get to see his"}, {"start": 392.0, "text": "current location."}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "So you can update the content of"}, {"start": 395.0, "text": "a Long Look in real time."}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "So any case where you're using a"}, {"start": 397.0, "text": "map, that is a nice example."}, {"start": 399.0, "text": "So if you have a social app, you"}, {"start": 401.0, "text": "could see your friends, maybe"}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "some sort of delivery service,"}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "flight tracking, things like"}, {"start": 405.0, "text": "that."}, {"start": 406.0, "text": "Or if you have dynamic data in"}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "your app, something that is"}, {"start": 408.0, "text": "based on live events, update"}, {"start": 410.0, "text": "that too. Stock prices, sports scores,"}, {"start": 412.0, "text": "social feeds, things like that."}, {"start": 414.0, "text": "If your app updates in real"}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "time, your notifications should"}, {"start": 417.0, "text": "update in real time."}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "And finally, you can go totally"}, {"start": 421.0, "text": "custom and build a really rich"}, {"start": 423.0, "text": "experience. So I can see my friend Chance,"}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "he sends me an iMessage, when I"}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "expand this, I see Messages"}, {"start": 429.0, "text": "draws the actual conversation,"}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "straight with bobbles and"}, {"start": 432.0, "text": "effects, and images and"}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "attachments, and because the"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "thread updates live, if he"}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "starts typing, we present the"}, {"start": 438.0, "text": "indicator."}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "And I think that is a really"}, {"start": 440.0, "text": "helpful piece of information"}, {"start": 442.0, "text": "because it lets me know to keep"}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "the notification open for just a"}, {"start": 445.0, "text": "moment longer, because when he"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "sends his next message, the"}, {"start": 448.0, "text": "thread updates, and it appears"}, {"start": 449.0, "text": "right inline."}, {"start": 450.0, "text": "Now, if I want to engage in the"}, {"start": 452.0, "text": "conversation I can reply to him,"}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "and we can go back and forth,"}, {"start": 455.0, "text": "and keep our conversation going"}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "until we're through."}, {"start": 458.0, "text": "Once we're done chatting, I just"}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "swipe the notification away, and"}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "I get back to what I was just"}, {"start": 461.0, "text": "doing."}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "So, Mic is a really cool app"}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "that builds a big part of their"}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "experience around our"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "notification platform."}, {"start": 470.0, "text": "So I can see they posted a"}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "Breaking News alert about a"}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "secret government spacecraft, I"}, {"start": 474.0, "text": "think. You know that sounds pretty"}, {"start": 475.0, "text": "cool, let me read that story."}, {"start": 476.0, "text": "So when I expand the Long Look,"}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "I get to see a big photograph"}, {"start": 481.0, "text": "from the article. I get the headline, and I get to"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "read the rest of the story."}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "I think it's really great."}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "You know, I expanded this"}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "notification because I was"}, {"start": 488.0, "text": "interested in the story and now"}, {"start": 489.0, "text": "I get to read the whole thing,"}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "and I never lost context of what"}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "I was doing."}, {"start": 495.0, "text": "Castro is my favorite podcast"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "app. It's really great."}, {"start": 498.0, "text": "It's really well done, and I get"}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "a notification every time there"}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "is a new episode."}, {"start": 501.0, "text": "So here, in the Long Look, I get"}, {"start": 504.0, "text": "to see the title, there's the"}, {"start": 505.0, "text": "duration, there's a nice"}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "description, and even a"}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "thumbnail of the show's artwork"}, {"start": 510.0, "text": "there in the bottom right."}, {"start": 511.0, "text": "And what's nice here is that"}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "it's typeset just like their"}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "app."}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "So I think this is a really nice"}, {"start": 515.0, "text": "example of how an app can bring"}, {"start": 517.0, "text": "their custom design language"}, {"start": 518.0, "text": "from their app into the"}, {"start": 519.0, "text": "notification experience."}, {"start": 521.0, "text": "It's really well considered."}, {"start": 522.0, "text": "It is really great."}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "And the Quick Actions are nice,"}, {"start": 524.0, "text": "too. You know, now that I've learned"}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "more about the show, I can just"}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "start listening."}, {"start": 531.0, "text": "And finally, Kuna."}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "This is one of my favorite"}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "examples. You know, this is a smart camera"}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "that you can place by your front"}, {"start": 536.0, "text": "door."}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "So here, you get a notification"}, {"start": 538.0, "text": "letting you know that your"}, {"start": 539.0, "text": "camera has detected some"}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "activity outside."}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "And I just think this is like"}, {"start": 543.0, "text": "the perfect case for a Long"}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "Look."}, {"start": 545.0, "text": "You know, if you are telling me"}, {"start": 546.0, "text": "someone is at my front door, you"}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "know, I want to see it, right?"}, {"start": 548.0, "text": "Like, I just want to play the"}, {"start": 549.0, "text": "video back right in the Long"}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "Look. So let's see what was happening"}, {"start": 552.0, "text": "outside."}, {"start": 553.0, "text": "It looks like my friend, Chance,"}, {"start": 554.0, "text": "is stopping by , oh,"}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "that's funny."}, {"start": 558.0, "text": "There's a real video for this"}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "camera, too."}, {"start": 560.0, "text": "He's okay."}, {"start": 561.0, "text": "And the click actions, too, \"Can"}, {"start": 562.0, "text": "I help you?\""}, {"start": 563.0, "text": "I think that's nice ."}, {"start": 565.0, "text": "All right, so let's recap here."}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "Let's make sure the Short Look"}, {"start": 569.0, "text": "is giving you clear information"}, {"start": 571.0, "text": "about what the notification is"}, {"start": 572.0, "text": "for."}, {"start": 573.0, "text": "Let's make sure the Long Look is"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "providing more context around"}, {"start": 576.0, "text": "the notification and bringing"}, {"start": 577.0, "text": "out some of those wonderful"}, {"start": 578.0, "text": "design details from your apps"}, {"start": 580.0, "text": "into the notifications."}, {"start": 582.0, "text": "Let's make sure we have some"}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "relevant Actions."}, {"start": 584.0, "text": "Remember, I am going to be able"}, {"start": 585.0, "text": "to do everything I need to do,"}, {"start": 587.0, "text": "and just take care of the notification."}, {"start": 589.0, "text": "You know, because if we all get"}, {"start": 590.0, "text": "together and we do that, the"}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "next time you hear this [bell"}, {"start": 594.0, "text": "rings], and the next time you see this, we won't have to"}, {"start": 596.0, "text": "worry, because we will know all"}, {"start": 598.0, "text": "those notifications will be"}, {"start": 599.0, "text": "something that is really great."}]}
